OL,3,GNEWSAImpact of psychedelic drugs 'could
OL,4,Abe linked to age'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAge could play an important role in how
OL,7,Fpsychedelic drug use relates to mental
OL,8,Fhealth, according to new research.
OL,10,FResearchers from Durham University
OL,11,Ffound adults with a history of using
OL,12,Fclassic psychedelics, such as
OL,13,Fpsilocybin (magic mushrooms) and LSD,
OL,14,Freported lower levels of anxiety and
OL,15,Fdepression than non-users - but only in
OL,16,Fyounger age groups.
OL,18,FThe associations became weaker with
OL,19,Fincreasing age and were no longer
OL,20,Fevident among older adults, researchers
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
