OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAImpact of psychedelic drugs 'could
OL,4,Abe linked to age'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe findings came from a survey of
OL,7,F1,088 adults aged 18 to 55 and over,
OL,8,Fwith participants asked about their
OL,9,Flifetime use of psychedelic substances
OL,10,Fand measured for anxiety, depression,
OL,11,Fwellbeing, and life satisfaction.
